  o Minor bugfixes (client, DNS mapping):
    - Setting DNSMappingFileMaxSize to 0, documented as disabling the
      size limit, made every anyone_hosts read fail: the "unlimited"
      sentinel (SIZE_T_CEILING) is rejected as invalid by
      read_file_to_str_until_eof(), so all .anyone lookups reported
      "No mapping found" despite a valid mapping file.  Clamp the
      effective read cap to SIZE_T_CEILING - 2 so 0 disables the limit
      as documented.
